Match based recommender
Babak Omelet: 
Ingredients: eggs:2, tomato:1, cheese:1 
Calories: 675
Steps:
Babak beats eggs in a mixing bowl until smooth
Parisa dices fresh tomato into small cubes
Paria grates cheese and adds to the egg mixture
Artin pours mixture into hot pan and cooks until edges set
Amirreza folds omelet in half and serves golden brown
Mahdi Grilled Cheese: 
Ingredients: bread:2, cheese:2, butter:1 
Calories: 620
Steps:
Mahdi spreads butter on outside of bread slices
Elahe places cheese between two bread slices
Amirali heats pan over medium-low heat
Kosar grills sandwich until golden and cheese melts
Erfan flips carefully and serves hot
Taha Scrambled Eggs: 
Ingredients: eggs:2, butter:1, salt:1, pepper:1 
Calories: 630
Steps:
Taha cracks eggs into a large bowl
Babak whisks eggs with salt and pepper until fluffy
Parisa heats butter in a non-stick pan over medium heat
Paria pours eggs into pan and stirs gently
Artin serves the creamy scrambled eggs on a warm plate
